**6.1 Indemnification by Contractor**  
The Contractor shall indemnify, defend, and hold harmless the Client, its officers, directors, and employees from any and all claims, damages, losses, or liabilities arising from the Contractor’s performance under this Contract.

**6.2 Indemnification by Client**  
The Client shall indemnify, defend, and hold harmless the Contractor, its officers, directors, and employees from any and all claims arising from the Client’s failure to provide the necessary permissions and documentation.

